OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1791381056
OL,3,CFormer Manchester City and Bury FC
OL,4,Cplayer Courtney Meppen-Walter dead
OL,5,Caged 32
OL,7,FFormer Manchester City youth player
OL,8,FCourtney Meppen-Walter has died aged
OL,9,F32, his former club has announced.
OL,11,FIn a social media post, Bury FC passed
OL,12,Fon their condolences to his friends
OL,13,Fand family.
OL,15,FThe post said: "We are deeply saddened
OL,16,Fto learn of the passing of former
OL,17,Fplayer Courtney Meppen-Walter, at the
OL,18,Fage of 32.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/4
