PN,36702
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1791381056
OL,3,CFormer Manchester City and Bury FC
OL,4,Cplayer Courtney Meppen-Walter dead
OL,5,Caged 32
OL,7,F"The thoughts and condolences of
OL,8,Feveryone at _buryfc are with his
OL,9,Ffamily and friends at this incredibly
OL,10,Fdifficult time."
OL,12,FThe defender began his career at
OL,13,FManchester City as a youth player, but
OL,14,FMeppen-Walter was released from the
OL,15,Fclub after being found guilty of
OL,16,Fcausing death by careless driving aged
OL,17,F18.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/4
