PN,36703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1791381056
OL,3,CFormer Manchester City and Bury FC
OL,4,Cplayer Courtney Meppen-Walter dead
OL,5,Caged 32
OL,7,FMeppen-Walter was jailed for 16 months
OL,8,Fin 2013 after causing the death of a
OL,9,Fbrother and sister by speeding in a
OL,10,Ftraffic collision.
OL,12,FThen aged 18, he was seen
OL,13,F"showboating" in a silver Mercedes
OL,14,FElegance CDI car before crashing into
OL,15,Fa red Nissan Micra while travelling
OL,16,Fnearly twice the 30mph speed limit in
OL,17,FCheetham Hill.
OL,19,FThe impact killed Kulwant Singh, 32,
OL,20,Fand Ravel Kaur, 37, in the 2012 crash.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/4
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
