OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F367A1791381056
OL,3,CFormer Manchester City and Bury FC
OL,4,Cplayer Courtney Meppen-Walter dead
OL,5,Caged 32
OL,7,FAfter his release, the former under-
OL,8,F18s England captain played for
OL,9,FCarlisle United before moving to a
OL,10,Fnumber of non-league sides including
OL,11,FChorley, Telford, and Radcliffe.
OL,13,FIn January 2024 he returned to his
OL,14,Fhome town of Bury to play for his
OL,15,Flocal club.
